            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. \"Hire Date\" Seniority as used in this Article XVIII shall mean the employee's original hire date, except that if an adjustment has been made as provided in Article XX, Section M or for time spent on layoff, the \"Hire Date\" shall mean the employee's adjusted hire date.",
